= Appendix

#guide[
  *Hint:* Use appendices for supplementary material that supports your proposal but would break the flow of the main text. Examples include: detailed equipment specifications, extended data tables, survey instruments, code snippets, or additional figures.

  At the proposal stage, this section is optional. You might include a draft survey questionnaire, a detailed equipment list, or preliminary data exploration scripts.
]
